WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.380
And here are the nominees for
Best Animated Feature Film.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.490
Before we went in,
we looked each other

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.430
and said we had a great
run on this movie.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.820
We should just be proud and
happy no matter what happens.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.010
Are you ready?

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:15.510
Frozen.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.010
[APPLAUSE]

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.870
I don't think I remember
much of anything

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.810
after they said our name.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.470
We knew that Walt had been
given a special Academy Award

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.390
but Disney Animation
hadn't won one yet.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:28.620
It meant so much.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.888
My heart was racing.

00:00:29.888 --> 00:00:32.430
We're going to do this together,
because we're collaborative.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.312
But we'll be fast.

00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:34.770
And we all wanted
to say something,

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.140
even though the Academy said
only one person can talk.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.853
Every step of the way
we did it together.

00:00:38.853 --> 00:00:40.770
So we just feel like we
had to do it that way.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.480
We're bringing this home to you.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.390
And for our personal
families, and dearest friends,

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:46.470
thank you so much.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.550
You guys are very sweet.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.820
My son had passed away just
before the movie came out.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.770
You guys said you
want to say something?

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:54.390
I said yeah, I think I would.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.000
We'd like to dedicate this
to our guardian angel.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.650
That's my son, Ryder Buck.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.700
A lot of people
afterwards and the press

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.880
like who is this Ryder Buck?

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.940
Who is this guardian angel?

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:06.650
You're out.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.930
You can't go back in
until the commercial.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.870
And I was there with Cate
Blanchett, Julia Roberts,

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:12.830
and Glenn Close.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.240
And they just looked.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.190
And they were just
like congratulations.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.290
My sister was with
me, so she was like--

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:19.930
I was like--

